{
    "title": "Monica AI: Chat, Create & Read",
    "description": "Meet Monica \r\nYour all-in-one AI pal, Monica isn't just chatty\u2014she's your creative sidekick for art, smart search summaries, outlines, copywriting, webpage translations, and condensing PDFs and videos into digestible insights. Monica's brainpower comes from cutting-edge AI models like GPT-4V, GPT-4, Claude, Bard, Gemini and DALL\u00b7E 3.\r\n\r\nAI Search\r\nPose a question and let Monica hunt down answers by sifting through multiple keywords and results.\r\nVoice Translator\r\nSpeak in your native language, and Monica AI will provide real-time translation.\r\nVoice Mode\r\nTap the headphones icon to chat in voice mode. Save yourself the trouble of typing.\r\nWeb/PDF/YouTube Summary\r\n Snag precise summaries without slogging through entire webpages, PDFs or YouTube videos.\r\nMake it More\r\nJust start with an AI drawing and escalate the weirdness\u2014Monica will whip up an entertaining story video with a single click.\r\nAI Chat\r\nEngage with various LLM models, such as GPT-4V, GPT-4, Bard, Claude-2, and Gemini all from one spot.\r\nAI Memo\r\nYour personal AI knowledge vault. Save webpages, chat logs, images, and PDF info to Memo for easy retrieval through conversation.\r\nDiscovery\r\nGet updates for trending and interesting threads once a day.\r\n\r\nGive it a whirl and prepare to be wowed by AI Chat!\r\n\r\nExplore even more AI magic at our web version  https://monica.im\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://monica.im/privacy\r\nUser Agreement: https://monica.im/terms\r\n\r\nDive in now\u2014let Monica redefine your digital world!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet Monica <br>Your all-in-one AI pal, Monica isn&#39;t just chatty\u2014she&#39;s your creative sidekick for art, smart search summaries, outlines, copywriting, webpage translations, and condensing PDFs and videos into digestible insights. Monica&#39;s brainpower comes from cutting-edge AI models like GPT-4V, GPT-4, Claude, Bard, Gemini and DALL\u00b7E 3.<br><br>AI Search<br>Pose a question and let Monica hunt down answers by sifting through multiple keywords and results.<br>Voice Translator<br>Speak in your native language, and Monica AI will provide real-time translation.<br>Voice Mode<br>Tap the headphones icon to chat in voice mode. Save yourself the trouble of typing.<br>Web/PDF/YouTube Summary<br> Snag precise summaries without slogging through entire webpages, PDFs or YouTube videos.<br>Make it More<br>Just start with an AI drawing and escalate the weirdness\u2014Monica will whip up an entertaining story video with a single click.<br>AI Chat<br>Engage with various LLM models, such as GPT-4V, GPT-4, Bard, Claude-2, and Gemini all from one spot.<br>AI Memo<br>Your personal AI knowledge vault. Save webpages, chat logs, images, and PDF info to Memo for easy retrieval through conversation.<br>Discovery<br>Get updates for trending and interesting threads once a day.<br><br>Give it a whirl and prepare to be wowed by AI Chat!<br><br>Explore even more AI magic at our web version  https://monica.im<br><br>Privacy Policy: https://monica.im/privacy<br>User Agreement: https://monica.im/terms<br><br>Dive in now\u2014let Monica redefine your digital world!",
